  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "follow: Introduce a common tap listeners that include stream id[s]",
  "description": "For many protocols, it's possible that a frame contains multiple\nstreams, so sending all the follow payload for all frames that pass\nthe follow filter is incorrect. The dissector doesn't know what\nstream the follow tap is listening to (and there could be multiple\nfollow taps, e.g. with TShark), so this has to be done in the listener.\n\nA number of protocols (maybe all?) should use this instead of\nfollow_tvb_tap_listener.\n\nPing #18231\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2026-05-28T14:06:25.831Z",
